C o m p i l a t i o n


      Original variables q in tons/day; revenue z in million RUB/day for scaling.
      Base price p0 and input a0 are defined at q0=100 tons/day.
      Extra product in this task is yogurt, on cream's shared line.
      Edit ../data/scenarios.csv, run ../scripts/prepare_data.py, then this model.
      An equivalent convex problem in raw-input variables is also solved.
      Independent supporting-tangent certificates are in the Python verifier.
  10  Set j /milk,kefir,cream,yogurt/, st /start1*start3/;
INCLUDE    C:\sarychev\Codex\magistratura\coursework\mmm-ppr\variant-11\models\scenarios.inc
  12  Set s / base,raw_80,raw_90,raw_110,raw_120,mk_time_80,mk_time_90,mk_time_110,cy_time_80,cy_time_90,cy_time_110,milk_price_90,milk_price_110,kefir_price_90,kefir_price_110,cream_price_90,cream_price_110,yogurt_price_90,yogurt_price_110,combined /;
